  "name": "Aegis of Dawn",
  "line": "Paladin",
  "description": "A shield made only of holy light. It unfolds from the paladin's raised hand: a curved lens of white-gold energy with a bright rim, a turning sigil on its face and a hot glowing heart, wrapped in bloom and throwing sunrays out in every direction. It holds as long as the paladin keeps it raised, then folds back into the hand.",
