  },
  "director_notes": "An original held holy shield for the Paladin line, built as an aura so it can be held as long as needed: start-up 0-1000 ms, seamless loop 1000-4000 ms, lower after. The shield is pure light: a `bubble` orb at the caster's hand with `squash` 0.28 makes a lens that faces the target, a hard white rim (a `steady` vertical ring), a smaller sigil ring and a little sun at its heart. Strong bloom (a wide glow and a tighter white one), sunrays as long streaking sparks shot out in every direction and motes drifting up. Sound: shimmer as it opens, a bright tap when it snaps open, a soft hum and a slow chime while held."
